        { icon:`<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="#3ab54a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3L4 9v12h16V9z"/><path d="M9 21V12h6v9"/></svg>`, title:'Compare trainers side by side', desc:'BMP scores make comparing coaches objective. A trainer with 50 glowing reviews outranks one with 2 — because consistency matters more than a single great session.' },
        { icon:`<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="#3ab54a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>`, title:'Unbiased, unsponsored results', desc:'Rankings are earned by verified client reviews — not paid for, not gamed. A PT cannot buy their way to the top. Trainers can appeal any review they believe is unfair, keeping the platform honest for everyone.' },
        { icon:`<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="#3ab54a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z"/></svg>`, title:'Give constructive feedback', desc:'Your review isn\'t just a star rating — it holds coaches accountable and helps them improve. Good feedback makes good trainers great.' },
        { icon:`<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="#3ab54a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 7H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h16a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2z"/><path d="M16 3H8L6 7h12l-2-4z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5"/></svg>`, title:'Your business', desc:'We don\'t take a cut of your transactions and actively encourage bookings to happen off the platform. We simply facilitate the successful meeting of trainer and client.' },
